# Line endings — Kyndra_UI_Polish_Prompt.md §0.2 Rule 6.
#
# Until this file existed, the repository had no line-ending policy: history
# held LF, Windows working trees held CRLF, and every save could rewrite a
# whole file's worth of invisible characters. That is how a one-line change
# turns into a whole-file conflict, and it had already broken a test that
# searched the stylesheet for "\n}\n" (tests/palette.test.ts).
#
# LF everywhere, in the repository AND in the working tree. There are no
# .bat/.cmd/.ps1 files in this project, so nothing here needs CRLF.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch these, and never try to diff them as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
